        internal_id,
        offset,
        limit,
        &index,
        &rtxn,
        &fields_ids_map,
        embedder_name,
        embedder,
        quantized,
        progress,
```

```rust
// crates/meilisearch/src/search/mod.rs, lines 2736–2745
