3. The workload owner awaits `fetch_assets`, so cancellation can drop it while asset downloads are pending:
   https://github.com/meilisearch/meilisearch/blob/fff2ef5a42658b16a937d922aabc3fb7f89f2018/crates/xtask/src/bench/workload.rs#L90-L103

