    // ...
}
```

4. `fetch_assets` owns its download children in a local `JoinSet` and awaits them. Tokio documents that dropping a `JoinSet` immediately aborts all tasks in the set:
   https://github.com/meilisearch/meilisearch/blob/fff2ef5a42658b16a937d922aabc3fb7f89f2018/crates/xtask/src/common/assets.rs#L77-L147
