5. `download_asset` opens and truncates the canonical destination before awaiting the body stream. It has neither a temporary-file publication step nor a cancellation guard that removes an abandoned destination:
   https://github.com/meilisearch/meilisearch/blob/fff2ef5a42658b16a937d922aabc3fb7f89f2018/crates/xtask/src/common/assets.rs#L187-L261

