- The origin records a remote UID only from the successful HTTP response:
  [`crates/meilisearch/src/proxy/enterprise_edition.rs#L289-L326`](https://github.com/meilisearch/meilisearch/blob/fff2ef5a42658b16a937d922aabc3fb7f89f2018/crates/meilisearch/src/proxy/enterprise_edition.rs#L289-L326)

