- Request timeouts and transport failures are returned as transient errors:
  [`crates/meilisearch/src/proxy/enterprise_edition.rs#L463-L506`](https://github.com/meilisearch/meilisearch/blob/fff2ef5a42658b16a937d922aabc3fb7f89f2018/crates/meilisearch/src/proxy/enterprise_edition.rs#L463-L506)

