  [`crates/index-scheduler/src/queue/mod.rs#L265-L300`](https://github.com/meilisearch/meilisearch/blob/fff2ef5a42658b16a937d922aabc3fb7f89f2018/crates/index-scheduler/src/queue/mod.rs#L265-L300)

