    if self.processing_tasks.read().unwrap().must_cancel_processing_tasks(&tasks) {
        self.scheduler.must_stop_processing.must_stop();
    }
}
```

3. The S3 snapshot path creates a multipart upload, stores the returned upload ID, and checks the stop flag at the beginning of each part iteration:
   https://github.com/meilisearch/meilisearch/blob/fff2ef5a42658b16a937d922aabc3fb7f89f2018/crates/index-scheduler/src/scheduler/enterprise_edition/s3.rs#L428-L487

```rust
